Comment: 0,0:00:42.06,0:02:11.90,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,#OP
Comment: 0,0:20:48.97,0:22:18.84,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,#ED
Comment: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:05.07,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Typesetting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:03.98,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,If you're a type B, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:08.25,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Leaving it unchecked can lead to potentially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.73,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,life-threatening problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:10.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:13.07,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:14.34,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,However, we do have a solution!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not {\i1}that{\i0} scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want to take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:26.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will I die too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:32.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're only six years old. What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:36.33,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:20.90,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.25,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I need to decide on her next nursery school soon or I'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:35.06,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The big companies where smart people work... {Was: "The big companies that smart people go to..." -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:37.42,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They're supposed to have day-care facilities on-site, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:41.64,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not in this country, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.71,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:49.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:54.55,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, did you get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:55.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:57.27,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're going home early these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.27,0:02:59.01,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.96,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,You usually took the last train home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:06.06,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,We had incredible sales last year because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.19,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,But at this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:11.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's not something you achieve with enthusiasm or grit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:13.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was just by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:15.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My name's "Daikichi," after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:15.59,TL Note,TL note,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi = "Great luck"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.12,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:18.91,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hold the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:22.54,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let me carry that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:23.87,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fourth floor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:27.55,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Feeling good as usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:29.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was just told off by this guy here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:33.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and I think I'm losing hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:36.82,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Getting good results once makes life harder, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:42.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, you really {\i1}do{\i0} have a child, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:44.93,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go judging someone based on their height! {Was: "Don't go deciding stuff based on someone's height!" -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're just so thin that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm wondering where the baby came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:50.70,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder about that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.85,0:03:52.90,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,He's two years old already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:56.17,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot. Put them down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.16,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.92,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,I can handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:00.84,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:02.83,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.14,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's as powerful as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:10.52,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I wish she had stayed in the sales department.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:13.99,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's been here a lot longer than I have,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:19.48,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and when she got pregnant, she asked for a demotion herself so she could go home at the regular time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:24.07,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The whole company was talking about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:29.99,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to take care of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't really decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:34.24,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:37.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's been wetting the bed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like she's really embarrassed about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:43.55,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,It might be a mental problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:47.05,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kids usually sweat a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:49.39,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,but since they don't sweat that much during winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:51.30,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,they have to pee more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:53.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I remember often being told
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.95,0:04:55.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,to use the toilet before sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:05:00.40,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must have had some pressing circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:02.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could ask her, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mothers are really important, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.85,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,A man shouldn't be complaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:09.66,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Just do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:13.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What did you do and play today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:18.59,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I read a picture book and had a staring contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:23.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.69,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:29.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll prepare dinner soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:36.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Moon-sama shrunk a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:50.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.08,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,How are things?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:54.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:55.88,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not asking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:02.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you say something about not wanting to get caught up in all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:05.85,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't do that since you really took her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:13.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come over by the weekend to look for a clue about her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:17.44,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Call me when you've arrived at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:19.73,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure she wears some warm clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll call Haruko too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:24.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin seems to be on good terms with her kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:30.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We passed a car again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:33.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:34.51,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.51,0:06:40.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:43.78,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:46.06,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to see you back here, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:58.13,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I don't have anything a child would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:07:02.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She seems to like grownup stuff. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:05.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've had enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:05.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:08.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't blame me if you get hungry later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:10.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm full.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:13.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for leaving some not eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.01,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:19.20,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:25.87,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Man, that was terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:27.71,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Both the mom and kid are so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.51,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:33.84,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,You really took this kid in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:36.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:41.62,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Following up, here's the weather report.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:45.19,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,It was sunny and clear skies all over the country today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:48.39,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Temperatures have risen by two degrees everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:50.61,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,which means pleasant weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:50.98,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just going to use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:53.32,Usaghi Main I,TV,0000,0000,0000,,Now, for tomorrow's weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:07:59.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I said I need to use the toilet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go with you sitting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:13.45,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Is she always like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:18.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She talks quite a lot at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:22.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She was enjoying herself on the train too, like it was a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:27.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that the people here were all uptight at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:31.46,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,It's not our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:37.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot. If adults are gloomy, kids tend to think they're mad that them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:41.07,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kids {\i1}are{\i0} like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:44.08,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it was like that for you guys too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:48.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See? It was the same for you, in spite of your thick head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:51.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And Rin is a lot smarter than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:51.80,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Shut it, baldy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.77,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you like Cat's Cradle, right? {TLC? Not "Cat's Cradle" this time? -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:08.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At least answer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:09.52,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.44,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm giving this to Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:19.28,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.79,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, auntie is going to do it, so pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:27.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're more of a "granny" than of an "auntie".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:30.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look old enough to be a grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:33.34,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,My, what a sweet girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:36.77,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that her standard for "old" is really high!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.77,0:09:38.00,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to do it now, so watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:43.82,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:47.77,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here's a four-step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:52.69,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:56.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A two-step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:09:58.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,An airplane!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.27,0:10:00.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:01.53,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:04.39,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.11,0:10:08.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This string is easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:09.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:12.83,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I knitted it from light wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:16.41,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's better suited for this than regular string.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:20.33,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right! She can probably juggle beanbags too, since she's so good. {Was: "...make beanbags..." -mushu; doesn't make sense in this context. TLC?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.79,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You wind it around your little finger like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:26.79,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:27.93,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:33.61,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,♪ With this one pattern, ♪ {Is singing supposed to be italicized? -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:35.38,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,♪ making summer clothes... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:37.32,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:39.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's what you wanted, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:41.88,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.20,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:44.79,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably Haruko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:47.12,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:49.70,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,They're pretty! What are they called?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:50.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Beanbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:54.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for coming over.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.17,0:10:54.20,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Higher!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.44,0:10:55.41,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.43,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.41,0:10:59.20,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Also, you're supposed to sing when you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:59.17,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing that you're raising her while working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:03.42,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,My husband doesn't help me with it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.60,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to Grandpa's house now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:10.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I think I might be able to find some clues about Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:11.06,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.11,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is really easy to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:15.04,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's important for a child to have a mother.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.11,0:11:15.07,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,You think I can do it too?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.07,0:11:17.29,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,First, you do this, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.29,0:11:18.14,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:08.95,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.63,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you should've at least written a will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.33,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you worried about Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.15,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A modem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:30.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's with your hair?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:38.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I had it done to match Reina-chan's!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:40.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And those clothes too...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.72,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're Kazumi onee-chan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:44.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Kazumi's?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:48.78,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, you shouldn't put old-fashioned clothes on a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:52.20,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I thought, they look great on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:56.17,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:13:00.72,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,I guess somehow it looks like a clothes for children nowadays if they're wearing it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.86,Usaghi Main Top,mom,0000,0000,0000,,This is so nostalgic.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.86,0:13:05.09,Usaghi Main Top,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You used to wear these when you were four, Kazumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:02.63,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,How was it at Grandpa's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No clues at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.09,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:11.41,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably better not to get impatient and ask Rin-chan about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:15.52,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.82,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,You may not know about this, but
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:21.95,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,your mom used to work even after you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:25.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You mean she wasn't always a housewife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:28.38,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,When she was pregnant with Kazumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:31.13,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,she overdid it and spent some time in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:35.73,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,By the time she was able to go back to her company, there was no place for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:39.44,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,She was really depressed about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:42.38,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi was tiny when she was born too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:47.84,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,She would often take a leave from work or come back early for you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:50.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:57.55,Usaghi Main,dad,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi was always the priority, which led to her becoming arrogant like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:03.91,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to be okay? Do you want your dad to give you a lift?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:06.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. We have time to go walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.58,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we come back sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:20.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Can we come back sometime?" she asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:28.85,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie will always be waiting here, so come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:30.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:39.27,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:41.74,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,But I want a grandchild!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:43.28,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look after the baby and everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:46.14,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,I can't raise a kid while working!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.39,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,I'll lose my womanly charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:51.73,Usaghi Main,girl1,0000,0000,0000,,I still want to wear swimsuits and go drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:58.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Rin, did Grandpa have a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what a computer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:01.98,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:04.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did Grandpa use one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.66,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The maid used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:08.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He had a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:10.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Her name was Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:17.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What was she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:21.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really remember. {TIMING ERROR: Shorten this. Start after she says "hmmmm." -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:39.67,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:45.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She didn't like me either and was always angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:48.76,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She was scary, so I forgot about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:52.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.15,0:15:57.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's pointless to say now, but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:16:00.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,raising a kid while working is really hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.04,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.19,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Since you'll always have to take care of everything in such limited time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:12.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Gotou-san, have you ever thought that you're sacrificing yourself for the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:14.07,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you talking about me changing jobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:17.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I know it's rude, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:21.36,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,It seemed like the best choice at the time. {TIMING ERROR: Shorten. Start after "hmmm." I just don't like having sounds like "hmmm" and "ah." -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.53,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,It turned out fine, so it's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:33.08,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,But if it wasn't fine, I wouldn't want to talk about it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.54,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,because words are too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:38.01,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,The "power of words," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.18,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Am I being too abstract?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:41.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:43.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I totally understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:47.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please teach me more about kids and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.97,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun, your kid is the older one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:55.03,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You{\i0} should be teaching {\i1}me{\i0}, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:24.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, it's okay to wake me up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:26.89,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But... it's just sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:29.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sweat or whatever, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:35.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a bad dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.39,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's it like to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are you going to die before I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.12,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The sadness of Grandpa passing away...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:50.88,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And anxiety about what to do if I die too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.20,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Scared about her own death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:59.62,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Without being able to understand each of it, everything got all tangled up and she can't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:04.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Everything will be okay until you become a fine young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:08.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,When will I become a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:12.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, everything will be fine until you become middle-aged!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:15.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Until then, I definitely won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:17.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Count on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:21.37,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:24.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And don't worry about wetting your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine if you use the toilet before sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:28.75,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But the toilet is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:30.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come along at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:34.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And if you still wet the bed after that, you'll just have to change your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:37.95,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:42.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not something to be mad about or laughed at for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:44.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.89,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.98,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the short notice, Hidaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:56.03,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This may be sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:58.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but please transfer me to a job that doesn't require overtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:02.77,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,What? Kawachi, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:05.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm {\i1}extremely{\i0} serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.61,0:19:09.50,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:12.11,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I personally think it's a waste,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:14.74,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,but I've got a kid of my own too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:18.23,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try to convince the chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:21.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I'll leave this in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.90,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,The lower ranks are going to make a fuss about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.30,0:19:26.85,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:28.85,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Why did it have to be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.51,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,You could ask another relative to take her in or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:33.79,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't tell him that {\i0}I{\i1} insisted on taking her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:38.47,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, there are nursery schools that take care of kids until late at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:41.28,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to work for anyone but you, Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:44.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, this might be sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:48.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but managers often get transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make such a big deal out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:55.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:20:02.70,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My department will eventually settle down even if I'm not around and everything would be back to normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:04.47,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If not, there's something wrong with the company itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:07.30,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not the case with Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:09.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Or so I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:12.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My reasoning should be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:13.90,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:18.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:19.40,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:21.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Towel, lunchbox,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:23.94,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,slippers, toothbrush, cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:25.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wrote your name on everything too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.05,0:20:25.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Futon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, wait, that's only for babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:28.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:43.17,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, saying that this isn't a sacrifice would be lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:47.77,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I hope I can think that way after a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:24.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, that thing you have on your towel and lunchbox...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:28.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know, the thing that looks like a big-eared dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:30.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:32.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a lop bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Lop? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:36.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:39.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:40.37,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:42.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! You need to go pee.
